==Release information==
The {{TCGP|Promo-B}} card was first made available to purchase from the Premium section of the in-game {{TCGP|shop}} on November 1, 2025 at a cost of 1 Premium Ticket, a currency only available to players with a Premium Pass subscription. Only one copy of this card can be purchased in this way.

