==Trivia==
This card's set number in the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion is 025, which is also {{p|Pikachu}}'s [[National Pokédex]] [[List of Pokémon by National Pokédex number|number]].

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY|Pikachu|42}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*{{m|Spark}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Pikachu}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

